# Baby Daemon v2 — Multi-Agent Architecture Implementation Plan

## Background & Current State

Baby Daemon v1 is a **working monolithic system** with these capabilities:
- **File watcher** (Chokidar) → detects new/changed chat logs
- **Summarizer** (Gemini 2.5 Flash) → extracts structured memories via LLM
- **Memory store** (`memory.jsonl`) → JSONL flat-file persistence
- **Vector store** (LanceDB + MiniSearch fallback) → semantic + keyword search
- **Idempotency** (SHA-256 fingerprints) → duplicate prevention
- **MCP server** → 5 tools, 1 resource, 1 prompt for AI host integration
- **CLI** → `memory-watch`, `memory search`, `memory read`, `memory dump`, `baby-daemon`

**v1 files:**
| File | Role | Lines |
|---|---|---|
| [watcher.js](file:///c:/Users/kolte/OneDrive/Desktop/all%20dev%20stuff/proj101/src/watcher.js) | File watching + pipeline orchestration | 264 |
| [summarizer.js](file:///c:/Users/kolte/OneDrive/Desktop/all%20dev%20stuff/proj101/src/summarizer.js) | LLM memory extraction | 152 |
| [memoryStore.js](file:///c:/Users/kolte/OneDrive/Desktop/all%20dev%20stuff/proj101/src/memoryStore.js) | JSONL read/write | 96 |
| [vectorStore.js](file:///c:/Users/kolte/OneDrive/Desktop/all%20dev%20stuff/proj101/src/vectorStore.js) | LanceDB + MiniSearch | 484 |
| [idempotency.js](file:///c:/Users/kolte/OneDrive/Desktop/all%20dev%20stuff/proj101/src/idempotency.js) | Duplicate prevention | 160 |
| [config.js](file:///c:/Users/kolte/OneDrive/Desktop/all%20dev%20stuff/proj101/src/config.js) | Gemini API init | 28 |
| [mcp-server.js](file:///c:/Users/kolte/OneDrive/Desktop/all%20dev%20stuff/proj101/mcp-server.js) | MCP tool/resource/prompt server | 554 |

**The v1 problem:** Everything runs in a single pipeline: `watch → summarize → store → vectorize`. There is no contradiction detection, no knowledge graph, no risk analysis, no planner, no self-evaluation, and no reasoning about the project as a whole.

---

## v2 Vision

Transform the monolithic pipeline into a **multi-agent architecture** where each agent has a single responsibility, agents communicate through a shared event bus, and the system can reason about projects at a higher level.

```
Chat Logs / Git / IDE Events
        ↓
┌─────────────────────────┐
│   Observation Agent      │  ← Watches filesystem, git, chats
└──────────┬──────────────┘
           ↓ (normalized events)
┌─────────────────────────┐
│   Memory Extraction Agent│  ← Extracts decisions, bugs, ideas
└──────────┬──────────────┘
           ↓ (candidate memories)
┌─────────────────────────┐
│   Contradiction Agent    │  ← Detects outdated/conflicting memories
└──────────┬──────────────┘
           ↓ (validated memories)
┌─────────────────────────┐
│   Knowledge Graph Agent  │  ← Builds relationships between entities
└──────────┬──────────────┘
           ↓ (enriched graph)
┌─────────────────────────┐
│   Planner Agent          │  ← Generates engineering tasks
└──────────┬──────────────┘
           ↓ (tasks + priorities)
┌─────────────────────────┐
│   Risk Agent             │  ← Detects architectural risks
└──────────┬──────────────┘
           ↓ (risk annotations)
┌─────────────────────────┐
│   Reasoning Agent        │  ← Answers: What happened? What next?
└──────────┘
           ↓
    Storage + Vector DB + Knowledge Graph
           ↓
    Dashboard / CLI / MCP
```

