## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> 1. **LLM Provider:** v1 uses Gemini exclusively. Should v2 support multiple LLM providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini) via an adapter pattern, or stay Gemini-only for now?

> [!IMPORTANT]
> 2. **Dashboard:** The spec mentions React + Tailwind. Should we build the dashboard as part of this v2 implementation, or defer it to v2.1? Building it adds significant scope.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> 3. **Queue System:** Should we start with BullMQ (requires Redis) or use a simpler in-process event emitter + file-based queue to keep the project dependency-light?

> [!IMPORTANT]
> 4. **Knowledge Graph Storage:** Full Neo4j, or start with an in-memory adjacency list persisted to JSON? Neo4j is powerful but adds operational complexity.

