#### [NEW] `src/v2/agents/memory-agent.ts`
**Refactors v1's** [summarizer.js](file:///c:/Users/kolte/OneDrive/Desktop/all%20dev%20stuff/proj101/src/summarizer.js) + [memoryStore.js](file:///c:/Users/kolte/OneDrive/Desktop/all%20dev%20stuff/proj101/src/memoryStore.js)

