## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Each agent gets unit tests with mock events
- Integration test: feed a sample chat log through the full pipeline and verify all stores are populated
- Harness agent serves as continuous automated evaluation
- Commands:
  ```bash
  npm test                    # Run all unit tests
  npm run test:integration    # Full pipeline test with sample data
  npm run test:harness        # Run evaluation harness
  ```

### Manual Verification
1. Start `baby-daemon watch ./logs` with v2
2. Drop a test chat log into `./logs`
3. Verify: memories extracted → contradictions checked → graph updated → tasks generated → risks identified
4. Run `baby-daemon reason "what happened?"` and verify coherent answer
5. Connect MCP server to Claude Desktop and test all new tools
6. Run migration on existing v1 data and verify no data loss

